   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Future, intention or prediction",
     "texto": [
      "**-(으)ㄹ 거예요** can express a plan/intention or a prediction: 가다 → **갈 거예요** (I'll go / I plan to go), 타다 → **탈 거예요** (I'll take / I plan to take). The concrete reading depends on the context: 내년에 한국에 **갈 거예요** = next year I'll go / I plan to go to Korea."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Something planned",
     "texto": [
      "**-(으)ㄹ 예정이에요** presents a plan as scheduled or arranged: 갈 예정이에요 = I have planned to go / it is scheduled that I go. It has a nuance of scheduling and is not simply the formal version of -(으)ㄹ 거예요."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
